{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Long Multiplication Calculator 是一款專為學習長乘法而設的計算工具，適合學生、家長及需要鞏固乘數表的人士使用。它會展示完整計算步驟，並提供乘法測試，現時由原價 US $0.99 <a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-140.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>展示完整長乘法步驟</h2>\n<p>此 App 支援較大數字與更多選項，輸入任何題目後會顯示完整長乘法計算步驟，方便對照學習。內置乘法測試可協助溫習乘數表，進一步掌握長乘法技巧。介面直觀易用，操作快速，而且可獨立運作，在網絡訊號微弱或離線時仍能正常使用。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-56-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-57-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-58-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-59-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-60-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-61-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Long Multiplication Calculator</li><li>應用類別：Education</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/long-multiplication-calculator/id6467819630?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.350307+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":297,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T19:17:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T22:41:41.006871+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:14:05.779016+00:00","content_hash":"dd483a0d8256dc0a2907569a406be86b8d5d2cdef4eb3c0af92e6c861c2656a1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.350307+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}